      "id": "claim_90ae5d5b563f4504b149bb45b479c1e1",
      "statement": "The dashboard owns browser sign-in through `@supabase/supabase-js`, using `VITE_SUPABASE_URL` and `VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY`, while the backend separately verifies the returned access token against Supabase Auth's published public keys and resolves the handler by email.",
